Most of tests/ is written for Starfish. The files listed below come from, or
are adapted from, third-party projects; their notices are reproduced here
because the copies themselves carry no per-file header. Files that keep their
own header (testharness.js, crash/chart.js, the React bundle's *.LICENSE.txt)
are listed for completeness. tests/cdp/ and the tests/pixel submodule have
their own LICENSE files.

